# Room server for the networked duel, in development.
#
# It is `server/`'s `wrangler dev`. Without this the game opens with online mode
# greyed out — which is also a legitimate way to run it, if all you want is to
# duel the machine.
#
# ⚠️ The port is **not** wrangler's default 8787, and the reason is commented in
# `server/wrangler.jsonc`: on Windows two processes can listen on the same port,
# and 8787 is contested. Change it there, change it here.
#
# In production the value is `wss://<worker>.workers.dev`, and it lives in the
# hosting's environment variables. Vite bakes the value into the build: changing
# it requires a rebuild.
VITE_ROOM_SERVER=ws://127.0.0.1:8930
